# 验证：scoreboard players list 的输出格式。
#
# 这个输出不是聊天格式，而是普通的多行 INFO；而且放在函数里控制台看不到，
# 所以这条命令必须从控制台跑。
#
# 期望：[Server: Added new objective 'q' successfully]
# 期望：[Server: Set score of q for player Steve to 5]
# 期望：Showing 1 tracked objective(s) for Steve:
# 期望：- q: 5 (q)

--- console ---
scoreboard objectives add q dummy
scoreboard players set Steve q 5
scoreboard players list Steve
